\import{base-macros}

\title{Disco}

\p{[Disco](https://github.com/disco-lang/disco) is a functional teaching language for [discrete mathematics](0020), implemented in Haskell.  Currently I'm collaborating with [[heinrichapfelmus]] on building a [basic web UI](https://disco-lang.github.io/disco-live/) so students can use Disco in their browser.}

